 during injection molding, the material flow in mold, the warpage and deformation after product forming.\\""}, {"activity": "Over-molding", "evidence": "\\"In-house over-molding capability with a specially designed 500-ton over-molding machine allows us to meet the cost-effective production requirements of our customers.\\""}, {"activity": "Chemical Testing", "evidence": "\\"Chemical Testing : Fogging, Flammability, Infrared / Xenon, Salt Spray, X-ray, Substance Analysis, Ageing, Melt Flow, Viscosity Bath & pH meter.\\""}, {"activity": "Colour Testing", "evidence": "\\"Colour Testing : Spectral light Box, Gloss Meter, Spectrophotometer Test\\""}, {"activity": "Functional Testing", "evidence": "\\"Functional Testing : Durability in Climatic Conditions (Temperature/Humidity), Electromagnetic Vibration, Abrasion, Fatigue Shaker, Soundproofing, Universal Material Testing Machine, Low Temperature & Low Humidity Simulation Chamber.\\""}, {"activity": "Noise Testing", "evidence": "\\"Noise Testing : Noise Room with Permanent Magnet Shaker from 5 to 7500 Hz\\""}]', '[{"tier": "TIER1", "hsCode": "8708", "evidence": "\\"Our Cut & Sew department blends years of experience, advanced machinery, and high-tech techniques to deliver automotive interior parts to exacting quality standards and specifications.\\"", "reasoning": "The description mentions ''automotive interior parts'' and various manufacturing processes used for automotive parts which falls under TIER1 classification related to ''Parts and accessories of motor vehicles''.", "confidence": "MEDIUM"}, {"tier": "TIER2", "hsCode": "3920", "evidence": "\\"Laminated Polyester Fabric High Quality Delivering 100% sunshade, our 3 layer HIGH QUALITY laminated fabric has passed GMW14553 standard\\" and \\"Because we make our opaque multi-layer laminates in-house, we can control all the key process variables to safeguard the quality and performance of the finished sunshades.\\"", "reasoning": "The text mentions ''laminated polyester